5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Let us begin with kindness and patience. In times of deception, a calm heart is our best tool. How shall we approach this trial?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,Logic is the only reliable tool here. We should focus on contradictions in speech and shifts in behavior. Consistency is key to identifying the wolf.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to find the wolf! Maybe we can tell by how nervous they look? I'll be watching everyone's faces really closely!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Mizuki, but let's make sure we listen to everyone. Harmony will help us trust each other more.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,Intuition is unreliable. I will be analyzing the flow of information and looking for patterns that deviate from the norm.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"A wise approach, Ryuji. @Sakura, your energy is wonderful, but remember that some wolves are very good at pretending to be cheerful.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,Exactly. We must be wary of those who try to steer the mood too aggressively or those who are too quiet.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,Oh! Does that mean I should be quiet? Or more loud? This is harder than I thought!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"Just be yourself, Sakura. @Mizuki, do you think we should establish a rule for how we share suspicions?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,It is better to let the conversation evolve naturally. Forced structures can hide the very inconsistencies we are looking for.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,I concur. Let the truth emerge from the dialogue. I shall offer guidance where the path seems clouded.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Agreed. For now, let us observe. If anyone claims a role, we must scrutinize the timing of that claim.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm going to ask lots of questions! That's how I solve mysteries in my books!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,I'll try to keep track of who agrees with whom. That might show us if someone is trying to hide behind another.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"That is a reasonable method, Midori. I will focus on the logical validity of the arguments presented.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,It seems we have a plan. Let us face the first night with courage.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
