36,1,1,talk,Servas,,The first morning is always the most tense. Let us speak openly. Does anyone have a feeling about the current atmosphere?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,The silence of the night is telling. I suspect the wolf is waiting for us to make a mistake. We should be cautious.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I had a bad dream! I feel like someone is hiding something big! @Ryuji, you're so quiet, what are you thinking?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Midori,,"It is early to judge, but I noticed Mizuki is very focused on our mistakes. Is that a sign of leadership or deflection?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I have information. Mizuki is the werewolf.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Servas,,"That is a very bold and direct claim, Ryuji. Are you the Seer?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Ryuji, that is a reckless accusation. To claim such a thing so early without evidence is a classic wolf tactic to sow chaos.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Sakura,,What?! Ryuji said it so seriously! But Mizuki looks so calm... I'm confused!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Midori,,"If Ryuji is the Seer, this is simple. But if he is the wolf, he is trying to eliminate Mizuki immediately.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I am the Seer. My divination is absolute. Mizuki is the werewolf.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Servas,,"If we trust Ryuji, the game ends today. However, we must consider if a wolf would be this brazen.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,Exactly. Think logically. Why would a Seer reveal themselves on Day 1 and risk being killed tonight? It is a play to force a vote.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Sakura,,But Ryuji doesn't usually lie! He's always so serious! I think he's telling the truth!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I am torn. Mizuki's logic is sound, but Ryuji's conviction is unwavering.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,My goal is to protect the village. Leaving a known werewolf alive for another night is an illogical risk.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Servas,,The weight of the evidence rests on Ryuji's role. I believe in his sincerity.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
52,1,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
53,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,You are all being led by emotion. Look at the facts: a sudden accusation with no prior buildup.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
